{"id":"n71965-1-9","stage":3,"title":"응답 · 应答","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71965-1-9-1","ko":"그쪽 회사에서 우리 회사와 거래를 하겠다고 해?","zh":"对方公司答应和我们做生意了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그쪽","meaning":"那里，那边","explanation":"그쪽：那里，那边","readings":[{"term":"그쪽","audio":"/audio/bbb24e368e31fe1aff31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17206","senseId":"2","lemma":"그쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사에서","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사와","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거래를","meaning":"交易","explanation":"거래：交易；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거래","audio":"/audio/60f81bab2175c15e62d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26752","senseId":"1","lemma":"거래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하겠다고","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bbb24e368e31fe1a","term":"그쪽","zh":"那里，那边","audio":"/audio/bbb24e368e31fe1aff31.mp3","entryId":"17206","definition":"指代对话双方已知的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["그쪽"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"60f81bab2175c15e","term":"거래","zh":"交易","audio":"/audio/60f81bab2175c15e62d0.mp3","entryId":"26752","definition":"以物易物或买卖商品。","pronunciation":["거ː래"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7b5c2d55de63ddcf245.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71965-1-9-2","ko":"아니, 아직 응답을 기다리고 있어.","zh":"还没有，还在等回复。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"응답을","meaning":"应答，回答","explanation":"응답：应答，回答；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"응답","audio":"/audio/3042803f7f907772893a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71965","senseId":"1","lemma":"응답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다리고","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"3042803f7f907772","term":"응답","zh":"应答，回答","audio":"/audio/3042803f7f907772893a.mp3","entryId":"71965","definition":"回答呼叫或提问。","pronunciation":["응ː답"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/80ad38837decdb199354.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71965","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9153,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["还没有，还在等回复。","对方公司答应和我们做生意了吗？","时间过得也太快了。转眼间下周就要考试了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对方公司答应和我们做生意了吗？","时间过得也太快了。转眼间下周就要考试了。","还没有，还在等回复。"],"answer":2}]}
